  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pacific Security College</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment supports Pacific island countries (PICs) to strengthen capacity, regional collaboration and policy responses to climate, cyber, maritime, environmental, human and traditional (and transnational) security, priorities identified in the 2018 Boe Declaration on Regional Security. The Pacific Security College delivers strategic training courses to Pacific security officials, including on Pacific security policy making and analysis and bespoke courses for PICs&#x2019; security agencies. The College provides contracted technical assistance from regional and international experts to assist with development and implementation of national security policy, from short term assistance with capability gaps to comprehensive tailored national security frameworks. The College enhances effective regional collaboration on the security priorities through production of blog/vlog materials and podcasts and through the facilitation of regional events focused on key regional security issues.</narrative>
  </description>
